{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{env.ADMIN_EMAIL}}"],
  "subject": "PAYMENT FAILED \u2014 {{ifempty(3.body.name, 3.body.email)}} \u2014 ${{2.amount}}",
  "html": "<h2 style=\"color:#b00020;\">\ud83d\udea8 Payment Failed</h2><p>A client payment just failed in Stripe. The client has been sent a friendly card-update email automatically. Review below and follow up if needed.</p><hr><h3>Client</h3><ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> {{ifempty(3.body.name, 'N/A')}}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> {{3.body.email}}</li><li><strong>HubSpot Contact:</strong> {{ifempty(4.body.results[0].id, 'No matching contact found')}}</li></ul><h3>Payment</h3><ul><li><strong>Amount:</strong> ${{2.amount}} {{2.currency}}</li><li><strong>Event Type:</strong> {{2.event_type}}</li><li><strong>Failure Reason:</strong> {{2.failure_reason}}</li><li><strong>Failure Code:</strong> {{2.failure_code}}</li><li><strong>Invoice ID:</strong> {{ifempty(2.invoice_id, 'N/A')}}</li><li><strong>Payment Intent ID:</strong> {{ifempty(2.payment_intent_id, 'N/A')}}</li><li><strong>Stripe Customer ID:</strong> {{2.customer_id}}</li><li><strong>When:</strong> {{2.failure_datetime}} ET</li></ul><hr><p><strong>Open in Stripe Dashboard:</strong><br><a href=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/customers/{{2.customer_id}}\">https://dashboard.stripe.com/customers/{{2.customer_id}}</a></p><p><strong>Failed payment:</strong><br><a href=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/payments/{{2.payment_intent_id}}\">https://dashboard.stripe.com/payments/{{2.payment_intent_id}}</a></p><hr><p style=\"color:#888;font-size:12px;\">Automated alert from Make.com CWI Automation \u2014 Scenario I: Payment Failure &amp; Dunning. Owner: brian@cwiai.net / (734) 812-9971.</p>"
}

{
  "from": "{{env.RESEND_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{3.body.email}}"],
  "subject": "Action needed \u2014 update your payment method",
  "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;color:#222;line-height:1.6;\"><p>Hi{{if(length(ifempty(3.body.name, '')) > 0, ' ' + first(split(3.body.name, ' ')), '')}},</p><p>We tried to process your recent payment of <strong>${{2.amount}} {{2.currency}}</strong>, but it didn't go through. This usually happens when a card has expired, was replaced, or hit a temporary hold from the bank \u2014 nothing to worry about.</p><p>To keep everything running smoothly, please take a moment to update your payment details:</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:28px 0;\"><a href=\"{{env.STRIPE_CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL}}\" style=\"background:#2b6cb0;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;\">Update Payment Method</a></p><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#666;\">Or copy and paste this link into your browser:<br><a href=\"{{env.STRIPE_CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL}}\">{{env.STRIPE_CUSTOMER_PORTAL_URL}}</a></p><p>Once your details are updated, we'll automatically retry the payment \u2014 there's nothing else you need to do.</p><p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email and we'll be happy to help.</p><p>Thank you!</p></div>"
}

{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{env.ADMIN_EMAIL}}"],
  "subject": "[ERROR] Make.com \u2014 Scenario I Payment Failure & Dunning Failed",
  "html": "<h2>Scenario I Error \u2014 Payment Failure &amp; Dunning</h2><p>A payment-failure event could not be fully processed. The client may NOT have received the card-update email \u2014 please verify in Stripe and follow up manually.</p><hr><h3>Known Payment Details</h3><ul><li><strong>Amount:</strong> ${{2.amount}} {{2.currency}}</li><li><strong>Event Type:</strong> {{2.event_type}}</li><li><strong>Failure Reason:</strong> {{2.failure_reason}}</li><li><strong>Stripe Customer ID:</strong> {{2.customer_id}}</li><li><strong>Invoice ID:</strong> {{ifempty(2.invoice_id, 'N/A')}}</li><li><strong>Payment Intent ID:</strong> {{ifempty(2.payment_intent_id, 'N/A')}}</li><li><strong>Stripe Dashboard:</strong> <a href=\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/customers/{{2.customer_id}}\">https://dashboard.stripe.com/customers/{{2.customer_id}}</a></li></ul><hr><h3>Error Details</h3><ul><li><strong>Error Message:</strong> {{error.message}}</li><li><strong>Failed Module:</strong> {{error.module}}</li><li><strong>Scenario Run ID:</strong> {{scenario.runId}}</li><li><strong>Timestamp:</strong> {{formatDate(now, 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss', 'America/New_York')}} ET</li></ul><hr><p style=\"color:#888;font-size:12px;\"><em>Automated alert from Make.com CWI Automation \u2014 Scenario I. Owner: brian@cwiai.net / (734) 812-9971.</em></p>"
}
